Mosaic is a new, standalone implementation. It extracts the normative
platform contract (display limits, tile/OAM model, MIDI-only audio policy,
cart budget and enforcement model) from the ESP-16 reference platform:

  ESP-16 Game Platform — https://github.com/f-cero/esp16-platform
  PPU-16 (ESP-PPU)      — https://github.com/f-cero/ESP-PPU
  midicore              — https://github.com/f-cero/midicore
  all Apache-2.0, Copyright 2026 their contributors.

Third-party components:
  stb_image / stb_image_write — public domain / MIT (nothings/stb)
  font8x8_basic — public domain (Daniel Hepper)
  SDL2 — zlib license (only linked by Mosaic Studio)
